# ============================================================
# VMarket - .dockerignore cho BUILD CONTEXT = THU MUC GOC REPO
# ============================================================
# Cac Dockerfile cua service Spring Boot deu build tu goc repo
# (vi can services/pom.xml - parent POM), vi du:
#   docker build -f services/auth-service/Dockerfile -t vmarket-auth-service .
#
# Vi context la ca repo, mac dinh Docker se gui TOAN BO thu muc (ke ca
# .git, frontend/node_modules, target/...) cho daemon -> cham va lam hong
# cache. File nay dung kieu ALLOWLIST: chan het, chi mo lai phan can thiet.
#
# LUU Y khi them thu muc dung chung moi (vd libs/common) ma service can
# build: PHAI them mot dong "!<duong-dan>" ben duoi, neu khong COPY trong
# Dockerfile se bao "file not found".
#
# frontend/ va cac AI service (Python) build voi context rieng cua chung
# nen KHONG dung file nay (moi thu muc co .dockerignore cua rieng no).
# ============================================================

# 1. Chan tat ca
*

# 2. Mo lai dung thu muc services/ (pom + source cua microservice)
!services

# 3. Trong services/: bo build artifact va file khong lien quan den build
services/**/target
services/**/.mvn
services/**/.git*
services/**/.env*
services/**/*.md
services/**/HELP.md

# 4. AI service (Python) co Dockerfile + context rieng, khong can o day
services/ai-search-service
services/chatbot-service
services/recommendation-service
